# Project Performance Dashboard

## Overview

This dashboard tracks project execution performance by comparing planned and actual duration, cost, progress percentage, and risk levels.

## Business Problem

Project managers need visibility into delays, cost overruns, and project risks.

## Key Insights

- Project progress averages 70%.
- Actual costs exceeded planned costs.
- Multiple projects show medium-to-high risk scores.
- Delays impact overall delivery timelines.

## KPIs

- Actual Cost
- Planned Cost
- Risk Score
- Progress Percentage

## Tools Used

- Power BI
- Excel
- DAX
- Data Visualization

